+   retired, and every flagship pane carries its avg monthly profit + win rate in the centre. */
+.sx-t th, .sx-t td, th.sx-f, td.sx-f, .sx-t th.sx-n, .sx-t td.sx-n, .sx-t th.sx-s, .sx-t td.sx-s,
